      {
        "title": "Clinical Pearl: The EVS Study",
        "icon": "school",
        "type": "remember",
        "layout": "half_width",
        "color_theme": "purple",
        "content": {
          "mnemonic": "EVS Rule",
          "explanation": "The Endophthalmitis Vitrectomy Study (EVS) established that PPV is only superior to Tap-and-Inject when presenting vision is Light Perception (PL) or worse. For HM or better, Tap-and-Inject is sufficient."
        }
      },
      {
